---
// Case study (entry) — Ledgerline customers: Northbeam.
---

<section id="case-study" class="section case-study">
  <!-- kit: case-study -->
  <article class="container">
    <header class="cs-head">
      <div class="cs-copy">
        <img class="logo" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/northbeam-logo/480/160" alt="Northbeam" width="480" height="160" />
        <span class="eyebrow">Customer story</span>
        <h1>How Northbeam closes its books in 3 days</h1>
        <p class="lead">Northbeam's four-person finance team cut month-end close from 11 days to 3 while revenue doubled — without adding headcount.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/demo">Book a demo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="https://ledgerline.com/media/customers/northbeam-one-pager.pdf" download>Download the one-pager (PDF, 612 KB)</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img class="cover" src="https://picsum.photos/seed/northbeam-team/1600/1000" alt="Northbeam's finance team at a whiteboard covered in a close calendar" width="3200" height="2000" />
    </header>

    <ul class="metrics" role="list">
      <li>
        <strong>3 days</strong>
        <span class="m-label">Month-end close</span>
        <span class="m-context">down from 11</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>92%</strong>
        <span class="m-label">Transactions auto-matched</span>
        <span class="m-context">up from 40%</span>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>0</strong>
        <span class="m-label">New finance hires</span>
        <span class="m-context">while revenue doubled</span>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <div class="cs-body">
      <aside class="facts" aria-label="About Northbeam">
        <dl>
          <div><dt>Customer</dt><dd><a href="https://www.northbeam.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Northbeam</a></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Industry</dt><dd>SaaS</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Company size</dt><dd>201–1,000 employees</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Region</dt><dd>North America</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Products used</dt><dd>Close, Reconcile</dd></div>
        </dl>
      </aside>

      <div class="story">
        <h2>The challenge</h2>
        <p>Northbeam sells to 6,000 Shopify brands across three currencies. Its finance team reconciled Stripe payouts against bank lines in spreadsheets — <strong>11 days</strong> every month, and growing.</p>

        <h2>The solution</h2>
        <p>Ledgerline connected Stripe, two banks and NetSuite in an afternoon. Bank rules matched payouts automatically, and the multi-entity checklist replaced a 140-row spreadsheet.</p>

        <figure class="quote">
          <blockquote>
            <p>“We closed March in three days and nobody stayed late. I didn't think that was possible at our volume.”</p>
          </blockquote>
          <figcaption>
            <img src="https://picsum.photos/seed/dana-whitfield/400/400" alt="Portrait of Dana Whitfield" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" />
            <span><strong>Dana Whitfield</strong><br />Controller, Northbeam</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <h2>The results</h2>
        <p>Close now takes three days. The controller spends the rest of the month on forecasting instead of matching, and auditors pull evidence straight from the close report.</p>

        <div class="cta">
          <p>See what Ledgerline would do for your close.</p>
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/demo">Book a demo <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</section>

<style>
  .cs-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .logo {
    width: 144px;
    height: auto;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }
  .cs-copy h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.25rem);
  }
  .cover {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .metrics {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 3rem 0;
    padding: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .metrics li {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.125rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .metrics li:last-child {
    border-right: 0;
  }
  .metrics strong {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--brand);
  }
  .m-label {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .m-context {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .cs-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 260px minmax(0, 720px);
    justify-content: center;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .facts {
    position: sticky;
    top: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .facts dl {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .facts dt {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--ink-3);
  }
  .facts dd {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .facts a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .story {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
  }
  .story h2 {
    font-size: 1.625rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }
  .story h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .quote {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--dark);
    color: var(--dark-ink);
  }
  .quote blockquote {
    margin: 0;
  }
  .quote p {
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.6vw, 1.625rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .quote figcaption {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.875rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .quote img {
    width: 52px;
    height: 52px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .cta p {
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .cs-head,
    .cs-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .facts {
      position: static;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .metrics {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .metrics li {
      border-right: 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }
    .metrics li:last-child {
      border-bottom: 0;
    }
  }
</style>
